-- it wraps and follows the end (1, (True, 4))
|bob hi, how are│
|  you today    █
|ann fine       █
-- scrolled up: not following (0, (False, 4))
|ann hello there█
|bob hi, how are█
|  you today    │
-- appended while scrolled up: the window stays (0, (False, 5))
|ann hello there█
|bob hi, how are│
|  you today    │
-- to the end: following again (2, (True, 5))
|  you today    │
|ann fine       │
|bob good       █
-- to the start (0, (False, 5))
|ann hello there█
|bob hi, how are│
|  you today    │
-- a page down (2, (True, 5))
|  you today    │
|ann fine       │
|bob good       █
-- narrower: wrapped again, still at the end (4, (True, 8))
|  you    │
|  today  │
|ann fine █
|bob good █
-- narrower, at the start (0, (False, 8))
|ann hello█
|  there  █
|bob hi,  │
|  how are│
-- taller: the end stays in view (0, (True, 4))
|ann hello there
|bob hi, how are
|  you today
|ann fine
|
|
-- scrolled to the start, then the window grows to hold all: following again (0, (True, 5))
|ann hello there
|bob hi, how are
|  you today
|ann fine
|bob good
-- and a new message follows (1, (True, 6))
|bob hi, how are│
|  you today    █
|ann fine       █
|bob good       █
|ann yes        █
-- shorter window, not following: the position stays (1, (False, 5))
|bob hi, how are█
|  you today    │
